WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.535
We did a game, I think,
the last time you were on or --

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.205 size:84% position:42%
We played a game called
"Two Truths and a Lie."

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-To see if you could tell
if I'm lying or not.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:09.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, right now
you're looking into my eyes.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:10.777 size:75% position:38% line:92%
See? You're doing --

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.679 size:75% position:38%
Yeah, you're already
in my head already.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know that, right? Wow.
-I do know that.

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:16.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
What I'm wondering is
if you know it.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Chuckles ]
-See? Already, yeah.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't even know
what you're talking about.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:22.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is fantastic.
But I'm going to break this --

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:25.191
You're not even blink--
You're not even blinking.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:25.892 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you're real good.
Okay, all right.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I want to see if you can
tell two truths and a lie

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.532 size:78% position:39%
and see if I can tell
which one is the lie.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, you're gonna try
and psych me?

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.103 line:92%
-Yep. I'm already in your head.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:40.306 line:92%
-Good luck with that, James.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:43.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-Okay, I wrote 'em down.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:46.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm going to give each one
the same weight.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:48.481 size:75% position:38%
So I'm going to read
three things, right?

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep.
-One of these is a lie.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:51.317 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.952
-And you're going to try
and figure out which one.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See, already you're doing --
It's like a magician.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now I'm going to read
all three of them.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I understand the rules!
Yeah, it's okay.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
One of them's a lie.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.330
We got that already.
-No, you can't ask any questions

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
until I've read
all three of them.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:08.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the rule,
and I'll make 'em.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right.
-Pfft!

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Number one. Okay, number one.
-Yeah.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:16.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have a cow part
in my shoulder.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.610 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Number two.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:22.315
I was a roller-skating waiter
at an A&amp;W Root Beer stand.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:22.849 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:27.887
-Number three. I have taken a
bubble bath in Oprah's bathtub.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.989 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.659 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-She would never!

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:38.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um...
-So ask me anything you want.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.299 line:92%
-What'd they sell at A&amp;W?

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.467 line:92%
-Well, they sold root beer.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
They sold all kinds
of hamburgers.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
They sold hot dogs,
French fries.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.474
-And you'd wheel yourself
out there in short shorts

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:48.141 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and go give it?

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.943
-You would go to the car.
You would take their order

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause we didn't have
speaker boxes at the time.

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:53.980 line:92%
You would skate it in there,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
give it to the
short-order cooks.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then when it was ready,
you'd skate it back out there,

00:01:58.685 --> 00:01:59.752 size:84% position:42% line:92%
put it on their window.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did Oprah know
you took a bubble bath?

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:03.923 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Well, she has a two --

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
She has both floors
of the Water Tower in Chicago.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's a guest apartment
on one of the floors,

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:14.200
and it has everything there
that you could possibly want --

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.804 line:92%
a bathtub, shower, everything.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.572
-Bathtub and shower in Oprah's?
-Right.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:22.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why would you have a cow part
in your shoulder?

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it's a surgical
procedure, and --

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:27.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Was it, like, a muscle thing,
or what is it?

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:27.981 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It's a tendon.

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:30.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
They put it in
if you hurt your shoulder,

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.252 line:92%
like, rotator cuff or whatever.

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:35.655 size:75% position:38%
They put it in there
to speed recovery.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.491 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow...

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.196 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I think I did it.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.731 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Moo!

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:46.166 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.401
All right. I think I broke you.
I don't know.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tariq, do you think
you understand?

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you think you know
which one's what?

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:54.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do. I do.
-You guys think you know?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys think you know
which one's a lie?

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.244 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Audience affirming ]

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:00.647 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I'm going to say...

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Drum roll ]

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.319 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going to say
number one is a lie.

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:10.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
You do not have a cow part
in your shoulder.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do have a cow part
in my shoulder.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.995 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
