00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?!

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was installed March,
a year ago,

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:23.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
