00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:26.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
I broke six ribs
and blew up my shoulder.

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:27.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh. Man.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:30.276 size:88% position:44%
Are you going to tell me
which one was the lie?

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.511 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Do you want to know?

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:34.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-What do you guys think?

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:37.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience shouting ]
Okay, what's --

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you take a bubble bath
