00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:41.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did --
-We'll be right back right --

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:44.524 size:78% position:39% line:92%
No, I'm just kidding.

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:47.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did not take a bath
